

# Subject: imperative mood, under 72 chars, naming the component, file,
# or token that changed. No metaphor, no aphorism, no colon-then-flourish.
#   Good: Fix dark recess to render as a step, not a hole
#   Good: Add ISO severity tones to state color tokens
#
# Body (optional): the why — constraints, alternatives, what was tried.
# Deeper rationale belongs in docs/components/*.md or in token comments,
# where a reader will actually look for it.
